  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Fae Farm",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/16459/450x258/fae-farm-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790046000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/16459-buy-fae-farm-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "Suepixels",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/4460059-1530138549.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Actually, I don't like and even don't play many games, but Faefarm is a pretty, cute, and colorful carefully designed farming life-sim game infused with fairy magic. However, I had some major difficulties at the very beginning with how to ace the fishing skill and figuring out some other things about how they work. To me this wasn't intuitive enough (no tutorial); Jump in and learn on the fly. Unless you played any other farming simulation game, you need to figure out stuff yourself. Once you make it somehow work, it's pure joy. I love the emotes for how they show their emotions. Conversion with the townies is cute and sometimes even humorous. Yet, there is no depth and they are limited, as once you play, though, they get repetitive. The soundtrack is beyond beautiful and I love how adorable this game looks. I love to explore all corners in this world. The designs and characters are cute; there is not much to select from at the beginning, but you can unlock clothes, hairstyles, and craft dyes; build your home and have multiple homes; decorate them; have magic seasonal and magical crops; and have a couple of other things. Once you are able to do spells, you can craft magic items and wings. I'm six hours in and enjoy it now—so much so when I dive into faefarm, I forget the world around me. Just started to build friendships and relationships. NPCs have a charming character attached to them. The World, the characters, and the music are absolutely beautiful. Buy it on sale here and enjoy it. I'm not sure if I would pay for the DLCs at full price but on sale I would try them. Would love to see a continuation or a sequel but I read Phoenix Labs belongs now to Gambit—I hope there is still a future and I do adore and love the artstyle and gameplay. It could use a bit more depth but that besides - it was 100% worth it for me."
    },
    {
      "game": "Endless Legend 2",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/18605/450x258/endless-legend-2-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790046000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/18605-buy-endless-legend-2-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Lokj",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Super jeu à jouer avec des amies ! \n\nCependant, n'hésitez pas a rappeler à l'ordre vos potes sur la durer de leur tours de jeu x) \n\nLes sessions de jeu peuvent vraiment être très longues et chronophages si certains sont lent dans leur prise de décisions, un paramètre existe pour ajouter un chrono pendant les tours de jeu mais durant le late game cela peu s'avérer compliqué ^^'\n\nL'autre petit bémol serait l'incapacité d'être spectateur des combats des autres, obliger de faire des stream en vocal de ces derniers pour ne pas s'ennuyer.."
    },
    {
      "game": "ARC Raiders",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/10142/450x258/arc-raiders-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790046000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/10142-buy-arc-raiders-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-0a1d23e",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Good game overall. Graphics, audio and gun play are great. There are little guns to my taste but it is what it is. The way you can be backstabbed by other people is annoying but it is a small minus in my opinion. If you have a friend to play this game together it is a blast."
    },
    {
      "game": "IL-2 Sturmovik: 1946",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/8447/450x258/il-2-sturmovik-1946-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1790046000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/8447-buy-il-2-sturmovik-1946-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-f5fd817",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Great game a little lacking on the content side of things but the community made mods and missions definitely carry. Its also playable without a Hotas but id highly recommend one, again playable but not fun without a hotas and sadly no gamepad support so its either janky keyboard or expensive Hotas. Something great that it has over the later games is its verity of factions and locations. Its spans from the Eastern front all the way to the pacific with odd under represented factions like finland and romania."
    }
